OSCam-mini vendored source directory

Upstream: https://github.com/gfto/oscam.git
Required local build features: MODULE_NEWCAMD, READER_IRDETO, READER_VIACCESS, CARDREADER_PHOENIX.

This directory is intentionally built from a source snapshot copied here by
scripts/vendor_oscam_mini.sh or scripts/vendor_oscam_mini.ps1. Once vendored,
there is no network access during cmake/build/install.


StreamRelay support is a narrow backport from OSCam trunk r11760
(OpenVisionE2/oscam commit d4b2b405a881eecaf8b45e85ccc33f02244c2f13).
Only module-streamrelay plus the minimum config/build/Radegast integration is
backported. OSCam-EMU and SoftCam.key emulation are not included.
